&lt;p&gt;The mystery of the Bermuda Triangle has never been solved in a satisfactory way. A science object team is sent to investigate the strange occurrences. A time slip opens the way to another dimension, and the protagonist is dispatched to explore it, whatever dangers may await him there.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[From &lt;a href="http://www.mobygames.com/game/pc88/yojigen-shjo-lydia"&gt;mobygames&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>